- Feeling about motherhood is in [Sad, Neutral]  
- Angry after latest childbirth is in [Yes]  
- Relax/sleep when newborn is asleep is in [No]  
- History of pregnancy loss is in [Miscarriage, Still-born Delivery]  
- Major changes or losses during pregnancy is in [Yes]  
- Fear of pregnancy is in [Yes]  

